WEBVTT

00:03:01.546 --> 00:03:04.640
In both cases, I shared with them

00:03:04.664 --> 00:03:08.656
what I believed in then and now:

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.014
that Sierra Leone is bigger
than all of us,

00:03:12.999 --> 00:03:19.818
and that Sierra Leone must be a secure,
peaceful and just society

00:03:19.842 --> 00:03:22.916
where every person can thrive

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.617
and contribute to national development.

00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:30.222
And so, I initiated peace talks
with the rebels.